	"notice": "Original 2002 microKORG, not microKORG XL or microKORG 2. Set the Global MIDI channel and MIDI filters. Panel CC assignments are configurable and omitted here; use the MIDI implementation matching your settings. For computer use, connect MIDI OUT to interface MIDI IN; connect interface MIDI OUT to hardware MIDI IN when controlling the instrument. Port names are intentionally empty: interface or app names do not reliably identify the attached hardware. Select this profile manually. This is partial coverage, not a complete MIDI implementation. The panel is an original schematic; virtual keyboard note numbers are illustrative and require MIDI learn or octave adjustment.",
